23591700,5758000,4923000,4553500,7340700,3309400,4112200,22275800,6372900,21439100,8053200,5472700,9522600,2824500]}},"profile":{"website":"https://www.jetson.com.my","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Specialty Chemicals","employees":529,"city":"Kuala Lumpur","summary":"Kumpulan Jetson Berhad, an investment holding company, engages in the manufacturing, property development, and hostel management businesses in Malaysia, Rest of Asia, Australia, Europe, North America, South America, the Pacific Island, and internationally. The company offers rubber products, moulds and tools, and silicone products; bonding, adhesives, sealants, and coating products under the DUNLOP, JEBSEN, BUILDCHEM, and BONDY brand names; industrial chemical, cementitious, and plastic injection moulding products consisting of plastic pails and other industrial REM and original equipment manufacturer (OEM) items; covers; anti-vibration systems comprising rubber-to-metal anti-vibration products, thermoplastic elastomer boots, microcellular polyurethane jounce bouncers, and dampers for OEMs for the automotive, railway, and industrial sectors; customized polymer products, including elastometric moldings, thermoplastics, and thermoset products; and industrial and food grade plastic packaging products. It also operates as a design and build turnkey contractor for civil construction works, general building works, interior works, renovation and restoration works, exhibition works and memorial, and museum and gallery work; and contractor and designer of aluminum cladding, glazing, curtain, wailing, and related aluminum works. In addition, the company develops semi-detached bungalows, and terrace houses, as well as industrial parks; manages hostels; trades in construction and building materials, component parts for the railway and infrastructure industries, and medical devices; and assembles and trades in automotive products. Kumpulan Jetson Berhad was incorporated in 1977 and is based in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia.","zh":"Kumpulan Jetson Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，成立于1977年，总部位于马来西亚吉隆坡，业务涵盖制造、房地产开发和宿舍管理，业务遍及马来西亚、亚洲其他地区、澳大利亚、欧洲、北美、南美、太平洋岛屿及全球。","lines":["橡胶与硅胶产品：制造橡胶产品、模具和工具以及硅胶产品，客户涉及多个行业。","粘合剂与密封剂：以 DUNLOP、JEBSEN、BUILDCHEM 和 BONDY 品牌提供粘合、粘合剂、密封剂和涂料产品。","工业化学与塑料注塑产品：生产工业化学、水泥基和塑料注塑产品，包括塑料桶和其他工业 REM 及 OEM 项目。","防振系统：为汽车、铁路和工业领域的 OEM 提供橡胶-金属防振产品、热塑性弹性体护套、微孔聚氨酯缓冲器和阻尼器。","定制聚合物产品：提供弹性体模制品、热塑性塑料和热固性产品等定制聚合物产品。","塑料包装产品：生产工业和食品级塑料包装产品。"],"lines_en":["Rubber and silicone products: Manufactures rubber products, moulds and tools, and silicone products for various industries.","Adhesives and sealants: Offers bonding, adhesives, sealants, and coating products under the DUNLOP, JEBSEN, BUILDCHEM, and BONDY brands.","Industrial chemical and plastic injection moulding products: Produces industrial chemical, cementitious, and plastic injection moulding products, including plastic pails and other industrial REM and OEM items.","Anti-vibration systems: Provides rubber-to-metal anti-vibration products, thermoplastic elastomer boots, microcellular polyurethane jounce bouncers, and dampers for OEMs in automotive, railway, and industrial sectors.","Customized polymer products: Offers elastomeric moldings, thermoplastics, and thermoset products.","Plastic packaging products: Manufactures industrial and food grade plastic packaging products."]}}